    "created_at": "2017-03-14T08:59:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-14T08:59:53Z",
    "body": "What's the status on Web Bluetooth peripheral / GATT server support?\r\n\r\nJFYI, I'm seeing JS APIs being designed for this in the IoT/device community.\r\nFor example, a couple existing JS BLE APIs:\r\n- Zephyr.js based their JS BLE peripheral API on bleno: https://github.com/01org/zephyr.js/blob/master/docs/ble.md\r\n- Another JS BLE peripheral API (limited to basic advertising):\r\nhttps://github.com/Samsung/iotjs/blob/master/docs/api/IoT.js-API-BLE.md",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
