    "body": "Looking forward to this. My specific use case is to allow users (via a web app) to use their phone as a microphone for their laptop or other device. There are of course more details, but that's the 1 sentence summary of the relevant part. If I understand correctly, that would be possible with this feature. If any of the pros here have roadmap estimates and/or details on what's happening in this space across the various implementers and relevant committees, I'd love to hear those!",
